second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 90, \"text\": \"**GERMAN CELEBRITY COUPLE: ANNA HENKEL-GRÖNEMEYER AND HERBERT GRÖNEMEYER'S ENDURING LOVE**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 92, \"end\": 244, \"text\": \"Berlin, Germany - In the world of German entertainment, few couples have captured the hearts of fans like Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer and Herbert Grönemeyer.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 245, \"end\": 379, \"text\": \"The talented actress and renowned singer, musician, and actor have been married for decades, and their love story is one for the ages.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 380, \"end\": 574, \"text\": \"According to multiple sources, including German media outlets and entertainment publications, Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer and Herbert Grönemeyer tied the knot in a private ceremony in the late 1980s.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 575, \"end\": 726, \"text\": \"The couple's union has been a subject of fascination for fans and the media alike, with many praising their enduring love and commitment to each other.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 727, \"end\": 816, \"text\": \"\\\"Anna and Herbert are a true power couple in the German entertainment industry,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 817, \"end\": 900, \"text\": \"Julia Fuchs, a German pop culture expert and professor at the University of Berlin.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 901, \"end\": 1042, \"text\": \"\\\"Their marriage is a testament to the strength of their love and their ability to balance their successful careers with their personal life.\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1043, \"end\": 1160, \"text\": \"The couple's love story is all the more remarkable given their individual achievements in the entertainment industry.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1161, \"end\": 1303, \"text\": \"Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer, born in 1953, was a talented actress who appeared in numerous German films and television shows throughout her career.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1304, \"end\": 1447, \"text\": \"Herbert Grönemeyer, born in 1956, is a multi-platinum selling singer, musician, and actor who has been a household name in Germany for decades.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1448, \"end\": 1541, \"text\": \"\\\"Herbert and Anna are an inspiration to us all,\\\" said German actress and friend, Iris Berben.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1542, \"end\": 1666, \"text\": \"\\\"They've built a life together that's filled with love, laughter, and a deep respect for each other's talents and passions.\\\"\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1667, \"end\": 1823, \"text\": \"Data from the German Federal Statistical Office shows that the couple's marriage has endured for over three decades, a rarity in the entertainment industry.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1824, \"end\": 2001, \"text\": \"According to a 2020 survey by the German magazine, _Bunte_, Herbert Grönemeyer and Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer were ranked among the top 10 most beloved celebrity couples in Germany.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2002, \"end\": 2153, \"text\": \"While the couple's personal life has been subject to media scrutiny over the years, they have consistently demonstrated their commitment to each other.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2154, \"end\": 2311, \"text\": \"In a 2015 interview with _Die Zeit_, Herbert Grönemeyer spoke about the importance of his marriage, saying, \\\"Anna is my rock, my partner, and my best friend.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 39, \"text\": \"**BERLIN, GERMANY - FEBRUARY 10, 1995**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 41, \"end\": 150, \"text\": \"German Actress Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer Ties the Knot with Swedish Politician Ernst Beckman in Private Ceremony\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 152, \"end\": 349, \"text\": \"In a surprise move, renowned German actress Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer, 42, has married Swedish politician Ernst Beckman, 50, in an intimate ceremony held at a secluded villa in the German countryside.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 350, \"end\": 500, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the couple, the wedding took place on February 5, with only a handful of close friends and family members in attendance.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 501, \"end\": 720, \"text\": \"The actress, known for her critically acclaimed performances in films like \\\"Die Verwandlung\\\" and \\\"Der Tod in Venedig,\\\" has been romantically linked to Beckman, a prominent figure in Swedish politics, for several months.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 721, \"end\": 912, \"text\": \"When reached for comment, Henkel-Grönemeyer's publicist, Ursula Müller, confirmed the news, stating, \\\"Anna and Ernst are absolutely thrilled to start this new chapter in their lives together.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 913, \"end\": 975, \"text\": \"They're a perfect match, and we couldn't be happier for them.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 976, \"end\": 1126, \"text\": \"Beckman, who currently serves as the Swedish Minister of Culture, has been a vocal advocate for arts and cultural exchange between Germany and Sweden.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1127, \"end\": 1276, \"text\": \"His relationship with Henkel-Grönemeyer has sparked speculation about potential collaborations between the two nations in the entertainment industry.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1277, \"end\": 1482, \"text\": \"In an exclusive interview with our publication, Beckman expressed his admiration for his new bride, saying, \\\"Anna is not only an incredibly talented actress, but she's also a kind and compassionate person.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1483, \"end\": 1582, \"text\": \"I'm honored to call her my wife, and I look forward to supporting her in all her future endeavors.\\\"\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1583, \"end\": 1741, \"text\": \"Henkel-Grönemeyer, who has been nominated for several German Film Awards throughout her career, has been relatively quiet about her personal life in the past.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1742, \"end\": 1948, \"text\": \"However, sources close to the actress suggest that she has found a sense of stability and happiness with Beckman, which has inspired her to take on new projects and challenges in the entertainment industry.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1949, \"end\": 2106, \"text\": \"The couple's whirlwind romance has captivated fans and followers on both sides of the border, with many taking to social media to congratulate the newlyweds.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2107, \"end\": 2237, \"text\": \"As they settle into their new life together, it remains to be seen what the future holds for this talented and influential couple.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Herbert Grönemeyer\", \"Ernst Beckman\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Herbert Grönemeyer\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Ernst Beckman\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
